    "category": "Strength",
    "description": "An 8-week program designed for intermediate athletes focusing on developing raw strength in the power lifts (Squat, Bench, Deadlift) and foundational Olympic lifts. Sessions are structured to be completed efficiently in about 60 minutes, three times per week.",
